<h2 style="color: #1A1A1A; margin-top: 0;">Action needed for your booking</h2>

<p>Dear {{customerName}},</p>

<div class="info-box">
  <p><span class="label">Booking:</span> {{rentalNumber}}</p>
  {{#if productName}}
  <p><span class="label">Item:</span> {{productName}}</p>
  {{/if}}
  <p>{{instruction}}</p>
  {{#if amountDue}}
  <p><span class="label">Down payment due:</span> TZS {{amountDue}}</p>
  {{/if}}
  <p><span class="label">Please do this by:</span> <strong>{{deadline}}</strong></p>
</div>

<p>If it is not done by then, the booking will be released and the item made available to other customers.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;">
  {{#if isId}}
  <a href="{{storeUrl}}/account/id-verification" class="btn-primary">Upload my ID</a>
  {{else}}
  <a href="{{storeUrl}}/account/rentals" class="btn-primary">My rentals</a>
  {{/if}}
</p>

<p>If you have any questions, please contact our support team.</p>

<p>
  Best regards,<br />
  <strong style="color: #D4AF37;">{{businessName}} Team</strong>
</p>
